        <svg class="deco" viewBox="0 0 300 230" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"><polygon points="300,12 300,120 190,12" fill="#f6efe0"/><path d="M0 110 A90 90 0 0 1 180 110Z" fill="#e63a2e" opacity=".9" transform="translate(-30 -20)"/><g fill="#111"><rect x="210" y="150" width="90" height="8"/><rect x="210" y="166" width="90" height="8"/></g></svg>
        <div class="b b1"><span class="sh"></span><span class="ball"></span></div><div class="b b2"><span class="sh"></span><span class="ball"></span></div><div class="b b3"><span class="sh"></span><span class="ball"></span></div><div class="b b4"><span class="sh"></span><span class="ball"></span></div><div class="b b5"><span class="sh"></span><span class="ball"></span></div><div class="floor"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="title"><p class="eyebrow"><i></i>Galería Cris Art</p><h1 id="galleryTitle"><span>Toda su</span><span class="arte">arte</span></h1></div>
      <div class="copy"><p>Catrinas, calacas, personajes, dioramas y piezas de temporada: <b>todo hecho a mano.</b></p><span class="cta">Toca una pieza para verla grande <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M12 4v15M5 13l7 7 7-7"/></svg></span></div>
